{"id":"n82369-1-7","stage":5,"title":"집중력 · 注意力","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82369-1-7-1","ko":"집중력 떨어지겠다. 음악 좀 끄고 공부하렴.","zh":"注意力会分散的。把音乐关掉再学习吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집중력","meaning":"注意力","explanation":"집중력：注意力。","readings":[{"term":"집중력","audio":"/audio/09053593b685c2af1650.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82369","senseId":"1","lemma":"집중력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집중력","audio":"/audio/09053593b685c2af1650.mp3"}},{"text":"떨어지겠다.","meaning":"丧失，失去","explanation":"떨어지다：丧失，失去；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"29","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨어지겠다","audio":"/audio/0cd7bfc663cc35b4e707.mp3"}},{"text":"음악","meaning":"音乐","explanation":"음악：音乐。","readings":[{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71115","senseId":"1","lemma":"음악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"끄고","meaning":"关","explanation":"끄다：关；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끄다","audio":"/audio/1e0c0d787abf4da9e67d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73443","senseId":"2","lemma":"끄다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끄고","audio":"/audio/459908d44d9fb17044c6.mp3"}},{"text":"공부하렴.","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부하다：学习，读书；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"공부하다","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23394","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부하렴","audio":"/audio/b0b5c6278822f727e889.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"09053593b685c2af","term":"집중력","zh":"注意力","audio":"/audio/09053593b685c2af1650.mp3","entryId":"82369","definition":"把关心或思维倾注到一件事上的力量。","pronunciation":["집쭝녁"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"丧失，失去","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"原有的不再具有。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]},{"id":"88caa317d96897c9","term":"음악","zh":"音乐","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3","entryId":"71115","definition":"用嗓音或乐器按照拍子和节奏发出声音，表达想法或感情的艺术。","pronunciation":["으막"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1e0c0d787abf4da9","term":"끄다","zh":"关","audio":"/audio/1e0c0d787abf4da9e67d.mp3","entryId":"73443","definition":"切断电流或机器运转动力的路径，使其停止运行。","pronunciation":["끄다"]},{"id":"002a60f979d8c3de","term":"공부하다","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3","entryId":"23394","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/88f1d36ce8a6af2e0fd1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82369-1-7-2","ko":"안 돼요. 전 음악 들으면서 해야 더 잘된다고요.","zh":"不行啊。我说过，听音乐才能学得更好呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼요","audio":"/audio/9f1cdf460348e44aca12.mp3"}},{"text":"전","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}},{"text":"음악","meaning":"音乐","explanation":"음악：音乐。","readings":[{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71115","senseId":"1","lemma":"음악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}},{"text":"들으면서","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；으면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들으면서","audio":"/audio/4a02dc66e51dca4738c9.mp3"}},{"text":"해야","meaning":"获得，取得","explanation":"하다：获得，取得；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"8","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해야","audio":"/audio/c8f942c39d369acda96c.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"잘된다고요.","meaning":"顺利，好","explanation":"잘되다：顺利，好；ㄴ다고：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"잘되다","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62302","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘된다고요","audio":"/audio/100c26a3b6fb491cbafa.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"88caa317d96897c9","term":"음악","zh":"音乐","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3","entryId":"71115","definition":"用嗓音或乐器按照拍子和节奏发出声音，表达想法或感情的艺术。","pronunciation":["으막"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"聆听他人的话或声音等。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"获得，取得","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"实现某种结果。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"2bf32329a9311a6d","term":"잘되다","zh":"顺利，好","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3","entryId":"62302","definition":"事情朝着理想的方向发展。","pronunciation":["잘되다","잘뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c8c75d36d350c9a31638.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.462,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=82369","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":176,"sequenceScore":3.9387,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["注意力会分散的。把音乐关掉再学习吧。","不行啊。我说过，听音乐才能学得更好呢。","你了解辣椒传入韩国的经过吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["注意力会分散的。把音乐关掉再学习吧。","不行啊。我说过，听音乐才能学得更好呢。","你了解辣椒传入韩国的经过吗？"],"answer":1}]}
